Multiport AC admittance varying capmod
* Provenance: original Sansho R17 circuit with synthetic parameters.
* sweep: capmod 2 3
.param probe=2
Vd d 0 0.95
Vg g 0 .78 ac 1
Ve e 0 0
Vb b 0 .08
M1 d g 0 e b dev l=.48u w=2.4u
.model dev nmos(level=10 version=4.4 tox=4.6n tsi=75n tbox=105n nch=1.1e17 k1=.42 vth0=.48 u0=.047 capmod={probe})
.ac dec 5 10k 100G
.save i(Vg) i(Vd) i(Ve) i(Vb)
.end
